 niversity Avenue entrance. We'll meet at the food court in the basement. W
 aseem will have a flag with a rat on it.\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nLet's ga
 ther and discuss AI 2040: Plan A\, the new scenario from the AI Futures Pr
 oject (the team behind AI 2027). Unlike AI 2027\, it's a recommendation ra
 ther than a prediction: an international deal in which the US and China ag
 ree in 2029 to avoid a race to superintelligence\, all AI research becomes
  publicly transparent\, capabilities scale slowly through the human range\
 , and the world pauses at top-human-expert level before deliberately build
 ing superintelligence in 2040 enforced by verification schemes and "mutual
 ly assured compute destruction" (China's datacenters get built in Canada\,
  of…\n\nHosted by Sean Aubin\, Abi ☀️☀️☀️ & waseem tesqie
LOCATION:MaRS Discovery District\, 101 College St\, Toronto\, ON M5G 0A3\,
  Canada
